# python -m coverage run -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider -m "not browser" && python -m coverage report
# app.py is exercised through Streamlit's AppTest and the browser tests, which run it in another process, so it is measured
# only in the AppTest runs; the browser tests are therefore left out of the coverage number.
[run]
source = src, app
omit =
    src/__init__.py

[report]
show_missing = False
skip_empty = True
